TEXT -416 56 Left 2 ;This example measure the Rotational Energy of the synchronous machine.\nThis is done by first feeding the load by 100MW from 2s to 5s by the generator\nAfter 5s the speed control is disabled so the speed of the \ngenerator decrease until it reach zero at 90s through the resistance of the\nactive load
